  "pinned": false,
  "description": "## Summary\n\n1. **Working files** include Vue components for AI model settings (`AIModelSettings.vue`, `AIModels.vue`), a `Chat.vue` component, and supporting store/service files for chat management.\n\n2. **The user requested** two fixes: repair the test chat functionality in `AIModelSettings.vue` and add a quick test chat button directly in the AI models list table.\n\n3. **`AIModelSettings.vue` was fixed** by properly assigning `llm_model: model.name` during test chat creation, adding a watcher to keep the model in sync, adding error/loading states, and disabling the test tab for non-LLM models.\n\n4. **`AIModels.vue` was enhanced** by adding a `fa-comment-dots` action button per LLM model row that toggles an inline expandable chat panel directly beneath the row using a `<template v-for>` double-row pattern.\n\n5. **Both fixes follow the project's Vue conventions**: `<script setup>` for imports only, `data()`/`computed`/`methods` in the default export, TailwindCSS/DaisyUI for styling, and `$chats.createNewChat()` with `temp: true` for ephemeral test chats.",
